 05:43:29','2026-03-10 08:49:26'),(5034,'ChIJ87Ua8eZLZTURudskmUAETuo',NULL,'써니팝','google','ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNzejhDQVJnEAE',5,'',36.3505518,127.3751685,'2020-02-17 21:00:28','2026-03-10 08:49:26'),(5035,'ChIJ87Ua8eZLZTURudskmUAETuo',NULL,'써니팝','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNZa3R1S3pnRRAB',5,'',36.3505518,127.3751685,'2019-04-08 19:10:38','2026-03-10 08:49:26'),(5036,'ChIJ7SzjdmBJZTURURh8KVZh6g8',NULL,'Barbie House','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN3X0o3WTd3RRAB',1,'',36.3504119,127.3845475,'2016-01-30 23:33:49','2026-03-10 08:49:28'),(5037,'ChIJveYhu2BJZTURAqg9-flOPqQ',NULL,'병천황토방순대 둔산2호점','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNvcU9uQjFBRRAB',5,'냄새가 전혀없고 맛있습니다. 사장님이 무뚝뚝하십니다\n\n-현재 폐업',36.349911999999996,127.3872136,'2019-02-02 19:18:25','2026-03-10 08:49:28'),(5038,'ChIJEX_Lf_RLZTURpO2Jo1kkS-Q',20891,'한신우동 대전둔산점','google','ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNWNDZTclpREAE',5,'유부가 많음',36.3499613,127.3872314,'2023-12-08 19:56:15','2026-03-10 08:49:29'),(5039,'ChIJEX_Lf_RLZTURpO2Jo1kkS-Q',20891,'한신우동 대전둔산점','google','Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pZeGVtRmFTVmszUm0xbE9FUlFiVE5NZVZaclVXYxAB',5,'',36.3499613,127.3872314,'2025-09-26 18:11:20','2026-03-10 08:49:29'),(5040,'ChIJy1D7umBJZTURMVew9WwO9TA',13588,'한신우동 대전시청점','google','ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCdzVtdkNREAE',4,'순살치킨이 다리살로 되어있어 부드러워요. 매운양념 마늘고추 반반했는데 둘다 꽤 자극적이네요. 매운양념은 달달한맛 하나도없는 매운맛 위주의 양념입니다. 가격이 저렴해서 좋아요.',36.3499613,127.3872314,'2023-01-27 01:11:14','2026-03-10 08:49:29'),(5041,'ChIJy1D7umBJZTURMVew9WwO9TA',13588,'한신우동 대전시청점','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtaF8yRjBRRRAB',5,'후라이드 11,000원으로 올랐네요\n살얼음 소주, 살얼음 맥주 신기해요^^',36.3499613,127.3872314,'2022-12-10 18:48:16','2026-03-10 08:49:29'),(5042,'ChIJy1D7umBJZTURfj4AWIYJHCU',13593,'종로맥가시청점','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNiX3J6UTRnRRAB',5,'최고의 맥주집',36.3499376,127.3872526,'2024-07-27 07:59:32','2026-03-10 08:49:30'),(5043,'ChIJy1D7umBJZTURfj4AWIYJHCU',13593,'종로맥가시청점','google','ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjMm9xRGVREAE',4,'깔끔하고 좋습니다',36.3499376,127.3872526,'2020-06-06 15:22:54','2026-03-10 0