,'2026-03-11 01:34:13'),(16357,'ChIJu5n6lwxJZTURvj4PErkoG1s',NULL,'신화수산','google','ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURtZ1lPQkxBEAE',5,'미리 준비해 놓은 모듬회가 있어서 고르고 아쉬워서 문어숙회 그리고 석화까지 구매했어요\n모듬회는 너무 얇아서 아쉬웠고 문어숙회는 잘 삶아져서 졸깃하니 맛나네요.\n그리고 석화는 숯불에 구워먹었어요 ㅎㅎㅎ',36.355995,127.40546169999999,'2022-01-30 04:06:03','2026-03-11 01:34:13'),(16358,'ChIJu5n6lwxJZTURvj4PErkoG1s',NULL,'신화수산','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ4dTdlNXFnRRAB',4,'왕게늘 먹었는데 정말 맛있었고요 가격은 키로당7만원 정도였구요 잘먹고 갑니다\n(상차림,매운탕비는 별도 )',36.355995,127.40546169999999,'2020-07-31 02:02:18','2026-03-11 01:34:13'),(16359,'ChIJ_VcOmQxJZTURB-tx4izPNFk',NULL,'한밭회센타','google','ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURBbmJTSEtREAE',1,'한개도 아깝다. 더럽고 불친절. 장사가 되는기 신기하다.',36.355818899999996,127.4056042,'2018-09-23 22:26:41','2026-03-11 01:34:14'),(16360,'ChIJ_VcOmQxJZTURB-tx4izPNFk',NULL,'한밭회센타','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtN29IeHNRRRAB',3,'가성비 좋지만 사람이 너무 많네요',36.355818899999996,127.4056042,'2022-12-18 11:35:58','2026-03-11 01:34:14'),(16361,'ChIJ_VcOmQxJZTURB-tx4izPNFk',NULL,'한밭회센타','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNnck9qeWt3RRAB',1,'쓰레기',36.355818899999996,127.4056042,'2018-02-18 00:10:16','2026-03-11 01:34:14'),(16362,'ChIJ_VcOmQxJZTURB-tx4izPNFk',NULL,'한밭회센타','google','ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURlbU5LaWJ3EAE',5,'코스파 최고! !',36.355818899999996,127.4056042,'2022-09-30 22:17:35','2026-03-11 01:34:14'),(16363,'ChIJ_VcOmQxJZTURB-tx4izPNFk',NULL,'한밭회센타','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtamJ6N2hBRRAB',5,'',36.355818899999996,127.4056042,'2022-12-05 23:57:13','2026-03-11 01:34:14'),(16364,'ChIJd6U7wQtJZTURmkd-LpgQwPw',NULL,'한가네해장국','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURpdVBESGx3RRAB',3,'',36.3569771,127.40833409999999,'2020-11-24 03:59:44','2026-03-11 01:34:14'),(16365,'ChIJj8kF1-NJZTURbkFKynHs5jA',1302,'시장김밥','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURobE92dWpnRRAB',5,'',36.3571309,127.40847739999998,'2023-03-01 23:56:13','2026-03-11 01:34:15'),(16366,'ChIJj8kF1-NJZTURbkFKynHs5jA',1302,'시장김밥','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwdWRYQTl3RRAB',5,'',36.3571309,127.40847739999998,'2023-08-24