2449769999999,'2025-03-11 04:41:26','2026-03-11 02:27:33'),(36751,'ChIJOUCkJwBJZTURNz1tmsrAcuo',17221,'캘리캘리','google','Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5TWVqRjNXRXhqWlVGWFFqaGhUR2hPY25OblpVRRAB',5,'아메리칸 스타일 음식점\n피자와 파스타가 맛있네요.\n주차장이 없는 것이 아쉬움\n평일이라 대기 없이 바로 착석.\n음식도 빨리 나오네요.',36.3285251,127.42449769999999,'2025-08-25 20:41:02','2026-03-11 02:27:33'),(36752,'ChIJOUCkJwBJZTURNz1tmsrAcuo',17221,'캘리캘리','google','Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kbGRWbFNRbmxYZGpSc01sWXhORVp0YVZKMlMzYxAB',5,'꽤 맛있음 대표 피자 정말 맛있고\n파스타는 괜찮은 편!',36.3285251,127.42449769999999,'2026-01-17 22:19:38','2026-03-11 02:27:33'),(36753,'ChIJOUCkJwBJZTURNz1tmsrAcuo',17221,'캘리캘리','google','Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOcWIydEVRMlZDVURGa09Ya3RkREJzVVZoTVZrRRAB',5,'인테리어도 이쁘고 피자 파스타 전부 맛있어요. 친구들과 몇번씩 재방문한 가게입니다.',36.3285251,127.42449769999999,'2025-12-19 10:59:22','2026-03-11 02:27:33'),(36754,'ChIJT8RN9idJZTUR5nZmqNQtzAU',NULL,'오주','google','ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURHbHVtZWJnEAE',4,'식사나 소모임 하기에 좋습니다.\n맛좋고 서비스 좋습니다.',36.327712399999996,127.42452890000001,'2021-11-26 16:53:53','2026-03-11 02:27:34'),(36755,'ChIJT8RN9idJZTUR5nZmqNQtzAU',NULL,'오주','google','ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURVMklqOVlBEAE',4,'24시 주점 굳',36.327712399999996,127.42452890000001,'2019-08-13 02:39:31','2026-03-11 02:27:34'),(36756,'ChIJT8RN9idJZTUR5nZmqNQtzAU',NULL,'오주','google','ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURvaThpQU13EAE',5,'칼국수 맛있어요',36.327712399999996,127.42452890000001,'2019-03-21 12:33:54','2026-03-11 02:27:34'),(36757,'ChIJT8RN9idJZTUR5nZmqNQtzAU',NULL,'오주','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNME9Uc2xBRRAB',1,'',36.327712399999996,127.42452890000001,'2019-12-13 07:08:57','2026-03-11 02:27:34'),(36758,'ChIJHerBkydJZTURAC_LIHrMckg',17225,'북경양꼬치','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREamF6UDF3RRAB',4,'양꼬치도 유명하지만, 요리가 참 괜찮은 식당.',36.3276927,127.4245308,'2024-04-12 08:02:08','2026-03-11 02:27:34'),(36759,'ChIJHerBkydJZTURAC_LIHrMckg',17225,'북경양꼬치','google','ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSaHJLVXRBRRAB',4,'맛있어요 :)\n만두 피 엄청 두꺼워요 ㅎㅎ\n양장피는 일반 중국집(?)에 파는 겨자 들어간 양장피가 아닙니다:)\n고기는 냄새안나고 맛있어요 ~